.TH PATH_READLINK 3
.SH NAME
path_readlink \- read value of a symbolic link
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "path_internal.h"
.PP
.B int path_readlink(const char* path, stralloc* sa);
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B path_readlink
reads the contents of the symbolic link at 
.I path 
and appends it to the 
.B stralloc 
buffer 
.I sa.
It automatically resizes the buffer to accommodate the link target.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the length of the link target string on success, or -1 on error.